obs The baton's claim-as-override clause could take a booked lap from another lane. I did not take one. Every OPEN row I could read names a ruling, a custody gate, or another ship's claimed path, and the inner prompt's own lesson says to widen to a new class of search rather than add another near-identical entry. I chose no build over a fabricated one.
